    "h1": "Anti-Counterfeit QR Verification That Customers Can Trust",
    "bodyHtml": "<p>A cloned QR code fails instantly against AuthiChain. Each code is Ed25519-signed and checked against an on-chain record, so a copy can never reproduce a valid signature.</p><h2>How it works</h2><ul><li>Scan the product QR — no app required</li><li>AI analyzes the image and cross-references the signed on-chain record</li><li>Get a 0–100 authenticity score in under two seconds</li></ul><p>Brands in luxury, pharma, and electronics use AuthiChain to give customers a one-scan proof of authenticity and a tamper-evident provenance trail. From $49/mo.</p>",
