  },
    "slug": "eu-dpp-compliance-checklist",
    "keyword": "eu dpp compliance checklist",
    "brand": "AuthiChain",
    "domain": "authichain.com",
    "title": "EU DPP Compliance Checklist | AuthiChain",
    "metaDescription": "A practical checklist for EU Digital Product Passport readiness: unique IDs, data carriers, verifiable credentials and tamper-evident records.",
    "h1": "EU Digital Product Passport Compliance Checklist",
    "bodyHtml": "<p>The EU Digital Product Passport, introduced under the Ecodesign for Sustainable Products Regulation (ESPR), rolls out by product category. Use this checklist to prepare.</p><h2>Readiness checklist</h2><ul><li>Assign each product a unique, persistent identifier.</li><li>Attach a scannable data carrier (QR code) that resolves to the passport.</li><li>Publish origin, materials and compliance data in a machine-readable form.</li><li>Make the record verifiable and tamper-evident, not just a static page.</li><li>Use an interoperable credential standard such as W3C Verifiable Credentials.</li></ul><h2>How AuthiChain helps</h2><p>AuthiChain issues DPP-ready W3C Verifiable Credentials anchored to Bitcoin L1, verifiable in under two seconds, from $49/mo.</p>",
    "jsonLd": {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
